# Roadmap SoT

**Role:** milestone status, done-summary, lean archive. **Not:** `tasks.md` mirror, feature dump, or deferred inventory. `M##` **allowed**.

Ownership: [DOC-OWNERSHIP.md](../../.specs/codebase/DOC-OWNERSHIP.md). Sync procedure: [roadmap-sync.md](../skills/vitals-common/references/roadmap-sync.md). Lint: `lintRoadmapDoc`.

## Forbidden

- `Artifacts:`, Sisters, `IDs:`/`HOTSPOT-*`, Depth/Priority laundry
- Out of scope / Final gate noise / Suggested execution order
- Further-horizon Deferred lists (→ STATE); task checkboxes; Post-* backlog for Done work

## Allowed

- Current table; Done summary; archive entries:

```markdown
## Milestone N — Name — DONE

→ [`.specs/features/<slug>/spec.md`](../features/<slug>/spec.md)

One-line outcome.

- Up to 3–5 capability bullets (not tasks)
```

## Sync

Do not paste Artifacts / HOTSPOT / Out of scope / gate / tasks. Content already in context/tasks/STATE → do not duplicate here.
